flowchart TD
    A[POST api/inventory/inbound] --> B[Auth policy OwnerOrManager]
    B --> C{JWT valid and active_shop_id present}
    C -- No --> C1[401 or 403 or ActiveShopNotSelected]
    C -- Yes --> D[Map request to AddInventoryCommand]
    D --> E[FluentValidation]
    E -- Fail --> E1[400 validation errors]
    E -- Pass --> F[Load actor user with memberships]
    F --> G{Member of active shop}
    G -- No --> G1[MembershipNotFound]
    G -- Yes --> H{Role owner or manager}
    H -- No --> H1[UserIsNotOwnerOrManager]
    H -- Yes --> I[Normalize item name and barcode]

    I --> J[Lookup item by barcode and by name in same shop]
    J --> K{Identity conflict}
    K -- Yes --> K1[ItemIdentityConflict]
    K -- No --> L{Existing item found}

    L -- Existing --> M[Use existing item]
    L -- None --> N[Create item and insert items]

    M --> O[Lookup batch by shop_id item_id batch_number]
    N --> O

    O --> P{Active batch exists is_voided=false}
    P -- Yes --> P1[409 BatchNumberAlreadyExists]
    P -- No --> Q[Create batch and insert inventory_batches]

    Q --> S[Resolve effective supplier: requested supplier or owner system Unknown Supplier]
    S --> T{Supplier resolution valid}
    T -- No --> T1[SupplierNotFound or SystemSupplierNotFound]
    T -- Yes --> U[Create IN stock transaction and insert stock_transactions]
    U --> V[Create GOODS_RECEIVED ledger and insert supplier_ledger_entries]
    V --> W[Lookup inventory aggregate by shop_id item_id]

    W --> X{Inventory exists}
    X -- No --> Y[Create aggregate with request quantity and insert inventory]
    X -- Yes --> Z[Add quantity and update inventory]

    Y --> AA[Upsert inventory and SaveChangesAsync]
    Z --> AA
    AA --> AB{DbUpdateConcurrencyException}
    AB -- No --> AC[200 OK AddInventoryResultDto]
    AB -- Yes --> AD{Retry attempts < 3}
    AD -- Yes --> AE[Reload conflicted entries and retry upsert]
    AE --> AA
    AD -- No --> AF[Throw InventoryUpdateConflictException]
    AF --> AG[Exception middleware maps to 409 Conflict]

    subgraph BatchEndpoint
      BA[POST api/inventory/inbound/batch] --> BB{Rows count > 0 and <= 100}
      BB -- No --> BB1[400 Inventory.BatchEmpty or Inventory.BatchLimitExceeded]
      BB -- Yes --> BC[Map rows to AddInventoryBatchCommand and invoke once]
      BC --> BD[Validate actor once and validate each row]
      BD --> BE[Per row process: same item or create item, enforce active-batch uniqueness, resolve effective supplier]
      BE --> BF[Collect succeeded and failed rows]
      BF --> BG{Any succeeded rows}
      BG -- Yes --> BH[Single unitOfWork SaveChangesAsync]
      BG -- No --> BI[Skip SaveChangesAsync]
      BH --> BJ{Any failed rows}
      BI --> BJ
      BJ -- No --> BK[200 OK AddInventoryBatchResponse]
      BJ -- Yes --> BL[207 Multi-Status AddInventoryBatchResponse]
    end
